      "writtenOn": "2024-07-11T15:43:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Whoops, yes I meant earliest. The compilation errors I got were along the lines of `/Users/jmbetancourt/Library/Android/sdk/ndk/21.3.6528147/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/lib64/clang/9.0.8/include/arm_neon.h:48377:49: error: ...`\n\nSomething like \"Confirmed to work with NDK versions above 23.0.7599858\" would serve as a hint to guide people to a working version.",
      "parentUuid": "832d583b_b190f6cf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 123,
        "startChar": 0,
